    "body": "What should BluetoothDevice.connectable return on Android, where we don't know if a device is sending connectable advertisements? I think we could leave it `false` or allow it to be `null`.\n\nAlso, what do you mean by \"be opposed the fact that we can pre-filter devices\"?\n",
