    "body": "I think it might be confusing for developers to have this member if android doesn't support it. Imagine a developer on macOS that writes the following line:\n\n``` js\nif (device.connectable) {\n  return device.gatt.connect();\n}\n```\n\nThat will work while he's developing but fail on real android devices.\n",
